#: lib/portfolio_web/live/photography_live/chapter_content.ex:176
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Like many in France, I grew up dreaming of Japan—immersed in manga, films, and the music of Joe Hisaishi, whom I hope to photograph one day. That fascination has never left me. As an adult, I wanted to go beyond the dream, to live there for several months and feel the soul and culture of the country from within."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/elixir.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Looking ahead, the shift toward decentralized and reactive systems (edge computing, AI coordination, live dashboards) plays directly into Elixir’s strengths — positioning it as one of the most future-proof choices for scalable, concurrent software."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/ci.html.heex:179
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Mise also lets you define CLI tasks, so you can standardize common workflows like setup, cleanups, and deployment helpers."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/ci.html.heex:127
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Mise is a modern version manager that supports multiple languages and tools — similar to asdf, but faster and easier to configure."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/photography_live/chapter_content.ex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Music has always been at the heart of my life. I began playing guitar as a child, and this early connection to sound and rhythm continues to shape how I perceive the world — and how I capture it through photography."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/photography_live/chapter_content.ex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "My landscape photography is deeply connected to my approach to street photography — both seek to capture the relationship between people and their environments. But in nature, the dialogue shifts. It becomes quieter, older, and more elemental."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/photography_live/chapter_content.ex:111
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "My main collaboration is with La Seigneurie de Coucy (my reenactment company), but I have also work with other inspiring reenactment groups such as Pont-Croix 1358, Gentes Comitis, Aeterna and more. These encounters enrich my photographic work, offering a tapestry of unique faces, gestures, and moments. Each project becomes a shared journey — where historical rigour meets artistic vision, and where the past finds new light through the lens."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/photography_live/chapter_content.ex:86
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "My photography is more than event coverage — it's a personal way to explore and share the emotional power of music. I aim to capture the invisible thread between artist and audience, the tension before the drop, the intimacy of a verse whispered under the stars."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/elixir.html.heex:384
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "OTP Applications can easily be combined and deployed across nodes in a distributed system. With node-to-node communication, you can scale horizontally and delegate tasks between different physical or virtual machines."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/kamal.html.heex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Once a functional app base has been created (in the case of an Elixir / Phoenix app, a simple `mix phx.new my_app` will suffice), it needs to be containerised. Kamal will need a container to deploy on the VPS. This container may not be hosted on Docker Hub, but in my case it is. By default, Phoenix offers a Docker file, which can be generated with the command `mix phx gen.release --docker`, which may do the trick. In my case I preferred to make a new one. An Elixir app is easy to containerise, so I took advantage!"
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/elixir.html.heex:272
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One of the core strengths of the BEAM is its philosophy of « let it crash » Instead of trying to prevent every possible failure, Elixir encourages writing small, isolated processes that can fail safely — and then be automatically restarted. This is where Supervisors come into play."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/amvcc_live/index.html.heex:187
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Our aim is not just to show objects, but to understand the uses, gestures, customs and social values of the Picardy Middle Ages, in order to give new meaning to the objects and their context."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/kamal.html.heex:360
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Overall, Kamal bridges the gap between manual server management and fully managed platforms, providing a great balance of simplicity, power, and transparency."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/elixir.html.heex:400
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Phoenix web servers, job processing platforms like Oban, and chat systems all leverage OTP applications behind the scenes. Each application encapsulates its logic, dependencies, and supervision trees, making them easy to compose and maintain."
msgstr ""

