#: lib/portfolio_web/live/tech_live/blog/elixir.html.heex:374
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The MyApp.Application module defines the entry point of your application. When deployed, this module ensures that your system starts in a predictable, fault-tolerant way using the supervision tree."
msgstr ""

#: lib/portfolio_web/live/amvcc_live/blog/clothes.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The clothing worn by a member of the “middle class” - a well-to-do craftsman, merchant, cleric or small-town notable - reflects his or her social status, the materials available locally, sumptuary laws and the fashions of the day."
